# OverlayBehavior - the opening, placing and closing of a floating panel; the floating parts (Popover, HoverCard,
# DropdownMenu, ContextMenu, Menubar, NavigationMenu) carry it. kind: popover | hover | menu | context | menubar | navmenu.
# shadcn-for-muten · Custom · host JS overlay-behavior.js (kit/overlays.js).
part OverlayBehavior(kind: text = "popover") { Custom OverlayBehavior inputs(kind: $kind) class("cx-ov-behavior") }
